    "title": "",
    "legend": "Variable sclerosis and permeation of the adjacent thyroid parenchyma. Cribriform and papillary growth predominates. Cribriform areas show follicle-like lumina with eosinophilic and bubbly mucinous secretions. Nuclei are uniformly enlarged compared with the adjacent non-neoplastic follicles and are ovoid with some degree of clearing and membrane irregularities but with prominent central nucleoli.",
